{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of Tring!. You can play the game up to 1212 points and try all the power-ups and upgrades that you come accross! You can even play with a friend! Two people can play using one keyboard (WASD is for Player 1 and directional keys are for Player 2)\u00a0 or two gamepads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1746299378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The way to score in this demo is bouncing the balls you shoot 3 times, either from the walls or from the enemy golden squares. Exploding a golden square also gives points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/extras/powerups.gif?t=1746299378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every three levels you get a chance to select an upgrade. You can choose more speed, more balls to shoot or one more HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/extras/bullet_time_enter.gif?t=1746299378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The white flying objects are powerups, you can go into bullet-time mode by getting the triple-circle power-up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/extras/tring_multi.gif?t=1746299378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A friend can join in the fun with local co-op or Play Together too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695240?t=1746299378","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695240?t=1746299378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/d14bf0c805cb328168d96c0eb867d95ca40553d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746299378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/d14bf0c805cb328168d96c0eb867d95ca40553d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746299378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of Tring!. You can play the game up to 1212 points and try all the power-ups and upgrades that you come accross! You can even play with a friend! Two people can play using one keyboard (WASD is for Player 1 and directional keys are for Player 2)\u00a0 or two gamepads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1746299378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The way to score in this demo is bouncing the balls you shoot 3 times, either from the walls or from the enemy golden squares. Exploding a golden square also gives points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/extras/powerups.gif?t=1746299378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every three levels you get a chance to select an upgrade. You can choose more speed, more balls to shoot or one more HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/extras/bullet_time_enter.gif?t=1746299378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The white flying objects are powerups, you can go into bullet-time mode by getting the triple-circle power-up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/extras/tring_multi.gif?t=1746299378\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A friend can join in the fun with local co-op or Play Together too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["siriculo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3680520","name":"Tring!"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695240/c52984d9c0681c32da6903e01578381b1604338c/header.jpg?t=1746299378","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Debian 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129996,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129996/movie480.mp4?t=1746299376","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129996/movie_max.mp4?t=1746299376"},"name":"tring_demo_trailers","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129996/4ce54302fc007cadca52b55194842980447b72c3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746299376","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129996/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746299376","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129996/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746299376"}}],"name":"Tring! Demo","pac